  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hailing from the forgotten sector of Street Wrecked Road, Mock is a survivor, piecing together scrap and rumors to stay one step ahead. He witnessed the Great Drip Drought firsthand and swore vengeance on those who hoarded the precious liquid, becoming a symbol of rebellion for the downtrodden ducks of Subchain City.",
    "class": "Vigilante",
    "name": "Mock 'The Mocker' Plagued",
    "personality": "Cynical and Resourceful: Mock's seen the worst of Subchain and trusts no one. He's always on the lookout for a better deal, but possesses a dry wit that can lighten even the grimmest situation. Driven By Justice: Though survival is key, Mock has a strong sense of right and wrong; a flicker of defiance burns bright. Mock will fight if there is any injustice dealt to innocents.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Mock uses his Odin Hammer to pulverize the earth creating a localized earthquake that stuns enemies in a small radius. This gives him a chance to waddle away or follow up with another attack.",
